<title>UK: BP sets Mar LPG price at $186/$205 a tonne.</title>
<headline>BP sets Mar LPG price at $186/$205 a tonne.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Petroleum announced on Friday evening its March price for Liquefied Petroleum Gas (LPG), the BP Agreed Price or BPAP.</p>
<p>Propane will be $186 a tonne, a fall of $176 a tonne from February's level of $362 a tonne.</p>
<p>Butane is down to $205 a tonne, down by $39 a tonne from February's $244 a tonne.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom, +44 171 542 6412</p>
</text>
